(k+1)!\n\nFactor out (k+1)!:\nS(k+1) = (k+1)! \u00b7 [1 + (k+1)] - 1\nS(k+1) = (k+1)! \u00b7 (k+2) - 1\nS(k+1) = (k+2)! - 1\n\nThis completes the inductive step.\n\nConclusion: By the principle of mathematical induction, S(n) = (n+1)! - 1 for all integers n \u2265 1. \u220e", "run_index": 2}
